| Feature/Gaps           | Status   | Technical Observation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| **Register Map**       | **FULL** | Replaced inferred placeholder registers with the complete, official map derived from `aon_reg.h`. This includes detailed bit-fields for DCDC converters (1.1V, 1.8V), LDOs, XTAL configuration, Analog Comparators (ACOMP), and the General-Purpose ADC (GPADC).                         |
| **Offset Correction**  | **FIXED**| Corrected all register offsets. Analysis shows the `aon_reg.h` offsets are relative to `0x2000F000`. Offsets in this file have been adjusted by -0x800 to be relative to the AON peripheral base of `0x2000F800`. For example, `aon` (C offset 0x800) is now at 0x00.                   |
| **Functionality**      | **EXPANDED**| Added full register definitions for previously missing hardware blocks like ACOMP and GPADC, which are part of the AON domain.                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Base Address**       | Explicit | 0x2000F800.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
-->
